# Names with non-ASCII letters must be quoted.
mode: syntax
---- query
t | project naïve
---- expected
IDENT@0..1 "t"
WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
PIPE@2..3 "|"
WHITESPACE@3..4 " "
IDENT@4..11 "project"
WHITESPACE@11..12 " "
ERROR@12..18 "naïve"
WHITESPACE@18..19 "\n"

error[DS0001]: names with non-ASCII characters must be quoted: `naïve`
  --> query:1:13
  |
1 | t | project naïve
  |             ^^^^^ unquoted name with non-ASCII characters
  |
  = help: quote the name: `['naïve']`
  = note: unquoted names use only the letters A-Z and a-z, digits and `_`
